    at a private party. Witnesses report he collapsed shortly after taking several
    sips from his glass.\r\n\r\n<b>Location:</b> Kitchen room.\r\n<b>Approx. Time
    of Incident:</b> 21:45 \u2013 22:00\r\n<b>Estimated Time of Death (prelim.):</b>
    \r\n22:05 \u2013 22:15\r\n<b>Cause of Death (prelim.):</b> Toxicity from a rodenticide
    detected primarily in Victor\u2019s wine glass. Concentration higher than other
    glasses."
